<section xmlns:image="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/image/" xmlns:custom="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/custom/" xmlns:xhtml="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/xhtml/"><section><section><header>INGREDIENTS</header><ul><li><paragraph>71g / ⅔ cup old-fashioned rolled oats</paragraph></li><li><paragraph>136g / ⅔ cup Greek yogurt</paragraph></li><li><paragraph>⅔ cup water</paragraph></li><li><paragraph>1 teaspoon vanilla or almond extract</paragraph></li></ul><header>PREPARATION</header><ol><li><paragraph>Combine ingredients in a large mason jar (or divide between two mason jars). Cover tightly with lid and shake. Set in fridge overnight to chill.</paragraph></li><li><paragraph>Remove from fridge next morning and enjoy!</paragraph></li></ol><paragraph><emphasize>Recipe credit: <link url_id="23">Credit Name</link> / <link url_id="41">CC BY</link></emphasize><line/><line/><emphasize>Photo credit: <link url_id="23">Credit Name</link> / <link url_id="41">CC BY</link></emphasize><line/></paragraph></section></section></section>